sequenceDiagram
    participant Pup as pup CLI
    participant Cache as Session Cache<br/>(~/.config/pup/mcp_session_{site}.json)
    participant MCP as MCP Server

    Pup->>Cache: Load cached session
    alt Cache hit (< 10min old)
        Cache-->>Pup: session_id, token, next_id
        Pup->>MCP: POST tools/list (session_id)
        alt Session still valid
            MCP-->>Pup: 200 OK
            Note over Pup: Use cached session
        else Session expired
            MCP-->>Pup: 400/401
            Pup->>Pup: Clear cache, fresh connect
        end
    else Cache miss
        Pup->>MCP: POST initialize (bearer token)
        MCP-->>Pup: 200 + Mcp-Session-Id header
        Pup->>MCP: POST notifications/initialized
        loop Poll until tools ready
            Pup->>MCP: POST tools/list
            MCP-->>Pup: {tools: [...]}
        end
        Pup->>Cache: Save session
    end
